{"ticker":"PPG","updated":"2026-11-20T23:15:31Z","profile":{"longName":"PPG Industries, Inc.","shortName":"PPG Industries, Inc.","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","country":"United States","website":"https://www.ppg.com","fullTimeEmployees":43500,"marketCap":25871808512,"trailingPE":16.449438,"forwardPE":13.534033,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.5499526,"pegRatio":1.63,"targetMeanPrice":130.13635,"targetHighPrice":140.0,"targetLowPrice":115.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.066,"earningsGrowth":0.011,"grossMargins":0.41181,"operatingMargins":0.13324,"profitMargins":0.094060004,"totalRevenue":16691999744,"beta":0.987,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":133.43,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":95.91,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.49},"summary":"PPG Industries, Inc. manufactures and distributes paints, coatings, and specialty materials in the United States, Canada, the Asia Pacific, Latin America, Europe, the Middle East, and Africa. It operates through three segments: Global Architectural Coatings, Performance Coatings, and Industrial Coatings. The Global Architectural Coatings segment supplies a variety of decorative coatings, adhesives, sealants, and finishes, as well as paint strippers, stains, and related chemicals. Its Performance Coatings segment offers aerospace coatings, automotive refinishing coatings, protective and marine coatings, and traffic solutions comprising paints, thermoplastics, raised pavement markers, and other technologies for pavement marking. The Industrial Coatings segment provides automotive OEM coatings, industrial coatings, and packaging coatings, as well as specialty products, such as optical monomers and coatings, low-friction coatings, and other specialty products. The company delivers its products to company-owned stores, home centers and other consumer retail outlets, paint dealers, concessionaires and independent distributors, company-owned distribution networks, and directly to manufacturing companies and retail customers. PPG Industries, Inc. was incorporated in 1883 and is headquartered in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania.","summary_zh":"PPG Industries, Inc. 在美國、加拿大、亞太地區、拉丁美洲、歐洲、中東和非洲生產和銷售油漆、塗料和特殊材料。該公司透過三個部門運作：全球建築塗料部門、高性能塗料部門和工業塗料部門。全球建築塗料部門提供各種裝飾塗料、黏合劑、密封劑和麵漆，以及脫漆劑、著色劑和相關化學物質。其高性能塗料部門提供航太塗料、汽車修補塗料、防護和船舶塗料以及交通解決方案，包括油漆、熱塑性塑膠、凸起路面標記和其他路面標記技術。工業塗料部門提供汽車原始設備製造商塗料、工業塗料和包裝塗料，以及特殊產品，如光學單體和塗料、低摩擦塗料和其他特殊產品。該公司向公司自有商店、家居中心和其他消費零售店、油漆經銷商、特許經營商和獨立分銷商、公司自有分銷網路以及直接向製造公司和零售客戶提供產品。 PPG Industries, Inc. 成立於 1883 年，總部位於賓州匹茲堡。","sector_zh":"基礎材料","industry_zh":"特種化學品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":108.66,"h":109.83,"l":107.85,"c":109.49,"v":2348900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":109.36,"h":109.72,"l":105.71,"c":106.24,"v":2150600},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":105.33,"h":106.63,"l":105.04,"c":105.48,"v":1686800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":105.26,"h":105.44,"l":103.64,"c":103.92,"v":1954900},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":104.58,"h":105.02,"l":103.29,"c":103.65,"v":1859000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":104.44,"h":105.28,"l":102.9,"c":104.02,"v":2244900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":104.15,"h":105.2,"l":103.52,"c":105.11,"v":1723300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":104.96,"h":105.51,"l":103.71,"c":104.09,"v":1588900},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":103.98,"h":105.32,"l":103.74,"c":104.52,"v":1333500},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":104.35,"h":105.38,"l":104.01,"c":104.43,"v":1160200},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":105.13,"h":105.13,"l":103.51,"c":103.52,"v":1466600},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":103.99,"h":104.27,"l":101.51,"c":101.7,"v":1412500},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":101.89,"h":102.05,"l":101.0,"c":101.59,"v":1519000},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":101.85,"h":102.04,"l":99.49,"c":99.6,"v":1650500},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":100.47,"h":101.79,"l":98.44,"c":98.48,"v":1772700},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":99.24,"h":99.89,"l":98.16,"c":98.86,"v":1420800},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":98.0,"h":101.34,"l":97.99,"c":100.5,"v":1362500},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":100.68,"h":101.36,"l":98.86,"c":99.56,"v":1517800},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":101.51,"h":101.84,"l":100.04,"c":1